List every live claim of the org on cards you can see, grouped by holder and
session: a header line per holder and session (name, agent or person,
session), then one line per card with its number, project, title, time since
it was claimed and the lease left. A summary line gives how many chats
(sessions), agents, people and projects. Org-wide: the global -p does not
narrow it.

Example:
  lorvik who

Usage
  lorvik who [flags]

Flags
  -h, --help   help for who

Global flags
      --api-url string   Server URL (default: LORVIK_API_URL)
      --json             Output the raw API JSON
  -p, --project string   Project slug (default: LORVIK_PROJECT or .lorvik.toml)
  -Q, --quiet            Suppress the unread notice on stderr and an empty inbox
      --session string   Session label for this chat (default: LORVIK_SESSION or derived; see lorvik session)
